Subject: [PATCH 11/31] build(docker): rename Compose project, services and
 images to hestia

- Compose project and network hestia, app service hestia-service, images hestia-service and
  hestia-caddy, BuildKit cache id hestia-pnpm-store, E2E projects hestia-e2e-<id>
